  "description": "The new Xtreme Race is a road bike designed to deliver advanced aerodynamic efficiency without compromising on comfort, handling, or overall weight. It is a highly versatile bike, suited for both fast, flat sections and long, hilly endurance rides, offering responsive handling and precise control in all conditions.\n\nKey Features:\n\nAerodynamic Geometry: Developed to reduce drag while maintaining excellent rideability, even over long distances.\n\nRoad Performance: Combines downhill stability with quick acceleration, offering an ideal balance of stiffness and comfort.\n\nFrame Technology\nThe monocoque frame is constructed from ultra-high-modulus carbon fiber. This specific engineering approach allows us to:\n\nReduce internal tube thickness to minimize weight.\n\nIncrease stiffness at key high-stress points.\n\nImprove the absorption of micro-vibrations from the road surface.\n\nThe bike is equipped with modern technical solutions to optimize both performance and maintenance:\n\nFully Integrated Cable Routing: Clean internal routing through the frame and handlebar, improving aerodynamics and aesthetics.\n\nUDH (Universal Derailleur Hanger): Features the universal standard for the rear derailleur hanger, ensuring easy spare part availability and optimal drivetrain protection.\n\nIntegrated Seat Clamp: The fastening system is seamlessly hidden within the frame to maintain clean, uninterrupted lines.",
